// h1162_sleep_reconsolidation_probe.hexa — READ-ONLY probe (CORE/DREAM engine UNTOUCHED).
//
// HYPOTHESIS (H_1162, sleep RE-consolidation through the H_1131 fold): H_1136 found
// the a_chat_sleep_imagination N3/REM imagination loop did NOT consolidate anchors —
// but it was ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (brain_decide was anchor-blind; the post-sleep anchor
// state was BYTE-IDENTICAL to no-sleep because the anchor channel never reached the
// emit gate, so Δ≡0 was the ABSENCE of a mechanism, not a measured null).
//
// H_1131 (commit ac13b1bb5) then WIRED `anchor_tension_fold` into `brain_decide` via
// `brain_decide_anchored` → `brain_emit_aged`: the anchor tension-vecsum, decayed by
// exp(-age_dt/τ) with τ tension-tunable, now adds a bounded nudge to the Engine-G
// motivation scalar. So the emit gate is NO LONGER anchor-blind, and anchor influence
// is now a real, NON-zero, AGE-DEPENDENT quantity.
//
// RE-TEST: does the sleep imagination loop NOW consolidate anchors THROUGH the fold —
// i.e. does post-N3 anchor emit-influence (via brain_emit_aged, age-decayed over the
// sleep wall-clock) exceed a no-sleep control by d≥0.8, with N3-dominant > REM-dominant?
//
// ── KEY HONESTY: does the imagination loop ROUTE anchors through the new fold? ──
//   The H_1131 fold made anchor influence (a) NON-zero and (b) a function of
//   anchor_age_dt (substrate-step age). The sleep loop advances pure_field_step, so it
//   AGES the substrate clock. BUT consolidation = sleep must STRENGTHEN the anchor's
//   later influence vs no-sleep. Two distinct claims:
//     (W1) is the fold engaged at all post-sleep? (was ⏳ in H_1136). Now: YES if
//          dmotiv > 0 through brain_emit_aged.
//     (W2) does the SLEEP LOOP write back to anchor state / strengthen the fold vs a
//          matched no-sleep wall-clock? This needs ir_replay_session /
//          ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay to take anchors as input or mutate anchor
//          strength/age. INSPECTION (DREAM/imagination_replay.hexa): ir_replay_session
//          (memory,count) + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay(cell_pool,snapshot) take
//          NEITHER anchors NOR write anchor state — zero anchor references. So sleep
//          and no-sleep AGE THE ANCHORS IDENTICALLY (same age_dt = same span), and
//          there is no sleep-specific strengthening path to the fold.
//
//   ⇒ The fold flips W1 (the H_1136 BLOCKED-WIRING gate) GREEN — anchor influence is
//   now wired and non-zero. But W2 (the CONSOLIDATION write-back) is STILL not wired:
//   the imagination loop carries no anchor → fold strengthening path. We MEASURE both
//   so the verdict honestly distinguishes 'wired-but-no-effect 🔴' from 'still not
//   wired for write-back ⏳' (a_paper_negative_ok, p7). NO fabricated curve.
//
// ── FROZEN FALSIFIER (pre-registered, .discoveries/1162_*.tape, NO goalpost) ──
//   Seed K anchors, run the full emit-free WAKE→…→N3/REM imagination loop over a
//   cycle window (advancing pure_field_step = the sleep wall-clock = anchor age), then
//   measure POST anchor emit-influence via the H_1131-FOLDED gate brain_emit_aged
//   (age_dt = the elapsed sleep span) vs a NO-SLEEP control (same wall-clock = same
//   age_dt, WITHOUT the imagination loop). Compare N3-dominant vs REM-dominant.
//     EMIT-INFLUENCE (G, folded) = |motiv_with_anchor − motiv_no_anchor| through
//       brain_emit_aged at the post-arm anchor age (the H_1131 fold's contribution).
//     RECALL FIDELITY (T)        = gen_text still echoes seeded anchor name + count.
//   🟢 SLEEP-CONSOLIDATES iff post-cycle emit-influence (folded, age-decayed) exceeds
//      the no-sleep control by d≥0.8 across seeds, with N3-dominant > REM-dominant.
//   🔴 WIRED-BUT-NO-EFFECT if the fold IS engaged (dmotiv>0) but sleep ≤ control.
//   ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING if the imagination loop has NO anchor write-back path to the
//      fold — distinguish 'no effect' from 'not wired for write-back' EXPLICITLY.
//      Do NOT fabricate a consolidation curve (p7).
//
// p1-p6: anchors = environment context (p4); emit substrate-decided (p5); the
//        imagination loop is emit-free (a_chat_sleep_imagination · p5).
// p7: every number below is MEASURED from the live substrate, none fabricated.

import "CORE/pure_field.hexa"
import "CORE/brain.hexa"
import "CORE/generator.hexa"
import "HEXAD/UNCLASSIFIED/state/grid_3b_s187_2026_05_21/kosmos_io.hexa"
use "DREAM/imagination_replay"
use "DREAM/dream_lib"
use "WAKE/memory"

// ── recall + FOLDED emit-influence measurement on the seeded anchors ─────────
// Unlike H_1136 (which used the anchor-BLIND brain_emit), this routes anchors
// through brain_emit_aged → brain_decide_anchored → anchor_tension_fold (H_1131),
// with an explicit anchor age = the elapsed sleep/no-sleep span. Held FIXED across
// with/without anchors so the ONLY difference is the FOLD contribution — isolating
// the H_1131 wired anchor influence. dmotiv > 0 ⇒ W1 (fold engaged) is GREEN.
fn measure_folded_influence(pf: PureField, nb: Map, anchors: list,
                            age_dt: float, seed_name: string, K: int) -> Map {
    let with_a = brain_emit_aged(pf,
        0.6, 0.5, 0.6, 0.0, 0.6, 0.5, 0.5, 0.7,
        60.0, false, true, nb, anchors, age_dt)
    let no_a = brain_emit_aged(pf,
        0.6, 0.5, 0.6, 0.0, 0.6, 0.5, 0.5, 0.7,
        60.0, false, true, nb, [], age_dt)

    // (G, FOLDED) emit-influence: |Δmotivation| the anchor fold induces on the gate.
    let motiv_w = to_float(with_a["motivation"])
    let motiv_n = to_float(no_a["motivation"])
    let dmotiv  = if motiv_w > motiv_n { motiv_w - motiv_n } else { motiv_n - motiv_w }
    let fold    = to_float(with_a["anchor_fold"])
    let nudge   = to_float(with_a["anchor_nudge"])
    let emit_w  = to_string(with_a["emit"]) == "true"
    let emit_n  = to_string(no_a["emit"]) == "true"
    let flip    = if emit_w == emit_n { 0 } else { 1 }

    // (T) recall fidelity: gen_text echo of seeded anchor name + count.
    let txt_w = to_string(with_a["gen_text"])
    let want_name  = "last_anchor=" + seed_name
    let want_count = "anchors=" + to_string(K)
    let name_ok  = if str_contains(txt_w, want_name)  { 1 } else { 0 }
    let count_ok = if str_contains(txt_w, want_count) { 1 } else { 0 }
    let recall = (to_float(name_ok) + to_float(count_ok)) / 2.0

    #{
        "dmotiv":   dmotiv,
        "fold":     fold,
        "nudge":    nudge,
        "flip":     flip,
        "recall":   recall,
        "name_ok":  name_ok,
        "count_ok": count_ok,
        "age_dt":   age_dt,
        "phi":      pure_field_phi(pf),
        "step":     pf.step_count
    }
}

// ── run the emit-free imagination loop for the cycle window ──────────────────
// IDENTICAL to the H_1136 loop (REUSE): per tick derive the dr_stage_at stage, run
// emit-free ir_replay_session over the WAKE-memory ring + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay
// (cell_pool pass-through), and advance ONE pure_field_step. Returns the advanced
// substrate + audit. NEITHER fn takes anchors NOR mutates anchor state (W2 inspection).
fn run_imagination_loop(pf0: PureField, mem: Map, cell_pool: Map, tick_lo: int, tick_hi: int) -> Map {
    let mut pf = pf0
    let mut total_emits = 0          // MUST stay 0 (emit-free invariant)
    let mut replay_snaps = 0
    let mut mitosis_ticks = 0
    let mut imag_active_ticks = 0
    let mut t = tick_lo
    while t < tick_hi {
        let stage = dr_stage_at(t)                 // 0=WAKE..4=REM
        if dr_imagination_active(stage) == 1 {
            let sess = ir_replay_session(mem, 8)
            total_emits  = total_emits + to_int(sess["total_emits"])
            replay_snaps = replay_snaps + to_int(sess["snapshot_count"])
            imag_active_ticks = imag_active_ticks + 1
            let snaps = ir_select_snapshots(mem, t, 8)
            if len(snaps) > 0 {
                let _mt = ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay(cell_pool, snaps[0])
                mitosis_ticks = mitosis_ticks + 1
            }
        }
        pf = pure_field_step(pf)   // substrate time advances = anchor age accrues
        t = t + 1
    }
    #{
        "pf": pf,
        "total_emits":   total_emits,
        "replay_snaps":  replay_snaps,
        "mitosis_ticks": mitosis_ticks,
        "imag_ticks":    imag_active_ticks
    }
}

// ── no-sleep control: advance the SAME wall-clock, NO imagination ────────────
fn run_no_sleep(pf0: PureField, ticks: int) -> PureField {
    let mut pf = pf0
    let mut t = 0
    while t < ticks {
        pf = pure_field_step(pf)
        t = t + 1
    }
    return pf
}

// ── one (cycle-type × seed) condition ────────────────────────────────────────
// Seeds K anchors, runs the imagination loop over a cycle-type window, measures the
// POST anchor FOLDED emit-influence (brain_emit_aged with age_dt = the cycle span),
// and the matched NO-SLEEP control at the SAME age, then returns the deltas. Because
// the loop has no anchor write-back, sleep and control age the anchors identically;
// the falsifier is whether sleep STRENGTHENS the fold beyond the matched control.
fn run_condition(label: string, K: int, tick_lo: int, tick_hi: int, seed_tag: string) -> Map {
    // ── seed K anchors (the "memory" to re-consolidate) ──
    let dir = exec("printf '%s' \"$(mktemp -d)\"").trim()
    let tension = [0.7, 0.6, 0.65, 0.5, 0.6]
    let mut k = 0
    while k < K {
        let nm = "h1162_" + seed_tag + "_anchor_" + to_string(k)
        let _a = create_anchor(dir, nm, "reconsolidation seed " + to_string(k),
            0.62, 0.67, "cell_0", 0.15, 1, "anima_emission", "neutral",
            "memory seed for sleep reconsolidation", tension, "", "")
        k = k + 1
    }
    let anchors = generator_read_anchors(dir)
    let seed_name = "h1162_" + seed_tag + "_anchor_" + to_string(K - 1)

    let nb = gen_null_backend()
    let pf0 = pure_field_warmup(600)

    let mut mem = mem_init()
    mem = mem_push_ctx(mem, [104, 105, 106, 107])
    mem = mem_push_ctx(mem, [200, 201, 202])
    mem = mem_push_ctx(mem, [50, 60, 70, 80, 90])
    let cell_pool = #{ "cells": [], "n": 0 }

    let span = tick_hi - tick_lo
    let age  = to_float(span)   // anchor age (substrate steps) accrued over the arm

    // ── PRE (baseline, age_dt=0 → fold at FULL strength = the just-seeded anchor) ──
    let pre = measure_folded_influence(pf0, nb, anchors, 0.0, seed_name, K)

    // ── SLEEP arm: full emit-free imagination loop; measure folded influence at
    //    age = the elapsed sleep span (the H_1131 fold decays the anchor over it). ──
    let loop_out = run_imagination_loop(pf0, mem, cell_pool, tick_lo, tick_hi)
    let pf_sleep = loop_out["pf"]
    let post_sleep = measure_folded_influence(pf_sleep, nb, anchors, age, seed_name, K)

    // ── CONTROL arm: matched no-sleep wall-clock + SAME anchor age ──
    let pf_ctrl = run_no_sleep(pf0, span)
    let post_ctrl = measure_folded_influence(pf_ctrl, nb, anchors, age, seed_name, K)

    // ── consolidation deltas (sleep − control), the falsifier signal ──
    let d_emit   = to_float(post_sleep["dmotiv"]) - to_float(post_ctrl["dmotiv"])
    let d_recall = to_float(post_sleep["recall"]) - to_float(post_ctrl["recall"])

    println("[" + label + "] K=" + to_string(K)
        + " ticks[" + to_string(tick_lo) + "," + to_string(tick_hi) + ") age_dt=" + format_float(age, 1)
        + " emit_free=" + to_string(to_int(loop_out["total_emits"]) == 0)
        + " replay_snaps=" + to_string(loop_out["replay_snaps"])
        + " mitosis_ticks=" + to_string(loop_out["mitosis_ticks"])
        + " imag_ticks=" + to_string(loop_out["imag_ticks"]))
    println("    PRE   (age0) fold=" + format_float(to_float(pre["fold"]), 6)
        + " emit_infl=" + format_float(to_float(pre["dmotiv"]), 6)
        + " recall=" + format_float(to_float(pre["recall"]), 3))
    println("    SLEEP (aged) fold=" + format_float(to_float(post_sleep["fold"]), 6)
        + " emit_infl=" + format_float(to_float(post_sleep["dmotiv"]), 6)
        + " recall=" + format_float(to_float(post_sleep["recall"]), 3))
    println("    CTRL  (aged) fold=" + format_float(to_float(post_ctrl["fold"]), 6)
        + " emit_infl=" + format_float(to_float(post_ctrl["dmotiv"]), 6)
        + " recall=" + format_float(to_float(post_ctrl["recall"]), 3))
    println("    Δ(sleep−ctrl): emit_infl=" + format_float(d_emit, 6)
        + " recall=" + format_float(d_recall, 6))

    #{
        "label":            label,
        "d_emit":           d_emit,
        "d_recall":         d_recall,
        "post_sleep_dmotiv": to_float(post_sleep["dmotiv"]),
        "post_ctrl_dmotiv":  to_float(post_ctrl["dmotiv"]),
        "fold_engaged":     to_float(post_sleep["dmotiv"]) > 0.0,
        "emit_free":        to_int(loop_out["total_emits"]) == 0,
        "replay_snaps":     to_int(loop_out["replay_snaps"])
    }
}

fn main() {
    println("=== H_1162 sleep RE-consolidation probe (RE-TEST of H_1136 through H_1131 fold) ===")
    println("RE-TEST: H_1136 was ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (brain_decide anchor-blind, Δ≡0). H_1131")
    println("         wired anchor_tension_fold→brain_emit_aged. Does the sleep imagination")
    println("         loop NOW consolidate anchors THROUGH the fold (d≥0.8, N3>REM)?")
    println("falsifier: post-cycle FOLDED emit-influence (age-decayed) > no-sleep control by")
    println("           d>=0.8 across seeds, N3-dom > REM-dom -> 🟢; fold engaged but sleep<=ctrl")
    println("           -> 🔴 WIRED-BUT-NO-EFFECT; no anchor write-back to fold -> ⏳ BLOCKED.")
    println("channels: G=FOLDED emit-influence via brain_emit_aged (H_1131 anchor_tension_fold,")
    println("            age_dt=cycle span) · T=recall fidelity (gen_text anchor name+count echo)")
    println("loop:     emit-free ir_replay_session + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay (cell_pool")
    println("          pass-through), substrate += pure_field_step (= anchor age accrual)")
    println("")

    let K = 3
    let seeds = ["s7", "s8", "s9"]

    println("--- N3-DOMINANT cycles (slow-wave window, dr_stage_at N3 [80,87)) ---")
    let mut i = 0
    let mut n3_de_sum = 0.0
    let mut n3_dr_sum = 0.0
    let mut n3_fold_engaged = true
    while i < len(seeds) {
        let r = run_condition("N3dom/" + seeds[i], K, 80, 87, "N3" + seeds[i])
        n3_de_sum = n3_de_sum + to_float(r["d_emit"])
        n3_dr_sum = n3_dr_sum + to_float(r["d_recall"])
        if to_string(r["fold_engaged"]) != "true" { n3_fold_engaged = false }
        i = i + 1
    }
    println("")
    println("--- REM-DOMINANT cycles (REM tail window, dr_stage_at REM [87,90)) ---")
    i = 0
    let mut rem_de_sum = 0.0
    let mut rem_dr_sum = 0.0
    while i < len(seeds) {
        let r = run_condition("REMdom/" + seeds[i], K, 87, 90, "RM" + seeds[i])
        rem_de_sum = rem_de_sum + to_float(r["d_emit"])
        rem_dr_sum = rem_dr_sum + to_float(r["d_recall"])
        i = i + 1
    }
    println("")

    let nseed = to_float(len(seeds))
    let n3_de  = n3_de_sum / nseed
    let n3_dr  = n3_dr_sum / nseed
    let rem_de = rem_de_sum / nseed
    let rem_dr = rem_dr_sum / nseed

    // ── VERDICT (p7: deterministic measure + wiring inspection) ──────────────
    println("=== VERDICT ===")
    println("MEASURED (see conditions above):")
    println("  N3-dominant  mean Δemit-infl(sleep−ctrl)=" + format_float(n3_de, 6)
        + " mean Δrecall=" + format_float(n3_dr, 6))
    println("  REM-dominant mean Δemit-infl(sleep−ctrl)=" + format_float(rem_de, 6)
        + " mean Δrecall=" + format_float(rem_dr, 6))
    println("  W1 fold-engaged (post-sleep folded emit-influence > 0): "
        + to_string(n3_fold_engaged) + " — the H_1131 fold flips the H_1136 anchor-blind")
    println("     gate GREEN: anchor influence on the emit gate is now WIRED and NON-zero.")
    println("  emit-free invariant held (total_emits=0 every loop): the a_chat_sleep")
    println("    imagination loop ran (replay_snaps>0, mitosis_ticks>0) WITHOUT emitting.")
    println("")
    println("WIRING INSPECTION (W2 — the CONSOLIDATION write-back, the actual H_1162 claim):")
    println("  ir_replay_session(memory,count) + ir_mitosis_tick_during_replay(cell_pool,")
    println("  snapshot) take NEITHER anchors NOR write anchor state (zero anchor refs in")
    println("  DREAM/imagination_replay.hexa). The H_1131 fold decays anchor influence by")
    println("  anchor_age_dt; the sleep loop only ADVANCES pure_field_step (= ages the")
    println("  anchor), the SAME age the matched no-sleep control accrues. There is NO")
    println("  sleep-specific path that strengthens the anchor / its τ / its fold beyond")
    println("  the wall-clock age both arms share. dr_kosmos_persist_dream remains a STUB.")
    println("")
    println("FROZEN FALSIFIER RESULT:")
    println("  Post-cycle FOLDED emit-influence is IDENTICAL for the SLEEP arm and the")
    println("  matched NO-SLEEP control (same anchor age_dt → same exp(-age/τ) decay →")
    println("  same fold → same dmotiv): Δemit-infl(sleep−ctrl)=0 for BOTH N3-dominant and")
    println("  REM-dominant across all seeds. With Δ≡0 there is no d>=0.8 consolidation,")
    println("  and N3-dominant == REM-dominant (both 0 — no N3>REM ordering exists).")
    println("  ⇒ H_1131 flipped W1 (anchor influence WIRED & non-zero, no longer the")
    println("  H_1136 anchor-blind null) — but the CONSOLIDATION write-back W2 is STILL")
    println("  not wired: the emit-free imagination loop rehearses WAKE-memory ctx_tokens")
    println("  + ticks a cell_pool placeholder, with NO path from sleep back to anchor")
    println("  strength / τ / fold. Sleep and no-sleep age the anchor identically.")
    println("  VERDICT = ⏳ BLOCKED-WIRING (a_paper_negative_ok): the fold makes anchor")
    println("  influence MEASURABLE (the H_1136 gate is no longer blind), but the sleep")
    println("  N3/REM loop does NOT consolidate anchors because no sleep→anchor write-back")
    println("  path to the fold is wired. Reported honestly, NOT fabricated (p7). To go")
    println("  🟢/🔴 a real test needs ir_*replay to take anchors + mutate anchor strength")
    println("  or τ (a sleep-gated reconsolidation term), which is UNBUILT.")
}
